farmi compagnia in questo nuovo -vecchio- capitolo🤍", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFYJefw-ng8AlTLAjBeT6OfHrylOr4z-xAA1R3yVIENGh6OE1s6_L_z9hn1XQFs--s&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEwpMSc&_nc_gid=0UY-uD3JmzIFiNuDlLqfow&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af-43D26CfRo0pBbDJ4RYR2jReswxOqmWuNCV7kaiE5NrQ&oe=6A2632AC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Ebbene si. \nI always had a YouTube channel that I never used but as an external hard drive to save videos that I would show my grandchildren when I was old.\nIn these fast times, of 30 seconds when you have to hit and hook, I felt the need to go back to the \"origins\" of long times, chats, videos with which we can compare and be together, maybe in a few, but without rush.\nFirst video comes out this Thursday (one a week, every Thursday).\nChannel link is already in bio.\nI hope you want to keep me company in this new -old- chapter🤍"}, "comment_count": 425, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "play_count": 1792691, "ig_play_count": 1673686, "fb_play_count": 119005, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "video_duration": 56.632999420166016, "is_dash_eligible": 1, "video_dash_manifest": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<MPD xmlns=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:2011\" xmlns:xsi=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xsi:schemaLocation=\"urn:mpeg:dash:schema:mpd:201